/reference/language-spec.compact.md:444:    CLAIM failure(system=authentication) BY agent STATUS hypothesized SOURCE "t1:s3" -> failure_3 : CLAIM
/reference/language-spec.compact.md:454:- `user`: STRING holder; `trip_days(value: NUMBER)` and `budget_usd(value: NUMBER)` are CLAIM relations describing requested trip duration and budget.
/reference/language-spec.compact.md:455:- `revises(previous: CLAIM, replacement: CLAIM)`: LINK; explicit replacement of the earlier claim by the later one.
